    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Navish Aleem's journey into nursing wasn't a typical one. At first, a nursing career seemed like a pipe dream, as her grades were not good enough to apply to medical school. However, this did not deter her; she applied to AKU in Pakistan, graduated with an undergraduate degree, and is now pursuing a Master of Science in Advanced Practice Nursing degree at AKUSONAM EA.",
